# Personal Obsidian UI state.
# These record which panes you have open, so they change every time you
# click around. Sharing them causes pointless merge conflicts.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

# Obsidian's trash and backup caches
.trash/
.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json.bak

# Claudian conversation history is local runtime state and may contain
# sensitive prompts, paths, or generated content.
.claudian/sessions/

# Operating system junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~

# NOTE: we deliberately do NOT block large files here.
# If git silently ignored your spreadsheet you would never know why it
# failed to sync. Keeping big files out of this repo is a rule people
# follow, not a filter - see "Where things belong" in README.md.

# IMPORTANT - MOBILE USERS ONLY
# On phones and tablets the Git plugin cannot use SSH, so it stores your
# GitHub access token in the file below. If anyone sets that up,
# uncomment this line immediately so the token is never committed.
# .obsidian/plugins/obsidian-git/data.json

# Local credentials and key material
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ---- Device-local Obsidian state: never sync (see repo sync policy) ----
.obsidian/appearance.json
.obsidian/graph.json
.obsidian/hotkeys.json
.obsidian/plugins/recent-files-obsidian/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/smart-connections/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/terminal/data.json
.smart-env/
conflict-files-obsidian-git.md
